[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Objectives]
Stage a preemptive strike on the attacking enemy. Do not allow the hostiles to capture the bridge.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Description]
The bridge is strategically important, but at present is only defended by a small infantry team. According to reconnaissance, the enemy is preparing to attack the position. You must advance swiftly, and stage a preemptive strike on the attacking enemy.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Success]
Mission accomplished.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Failed]
